<item>
            <title>[ITEP-92856] Automated LIDAR-Camera Calibration for Sensor Fusion</title>
                <link>https://jira.devtools.intel.com/browse/ITEP-92856</link>
                <project id="99912" key="ITEP">EdgeSW</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Customer / Persona&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Multi-Sensor Fusion Implementers&lt;/b&gt;&#160;- Organizations deploying LIDAR-camera fusion solutions for spatial intelligence and object detection applications&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Business Objective&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Enable scalable deployment of LIDAR-camera fusion systems by eliminating manual calibration requirements in field installations.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Functional Requirements&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;DLStreamer Auto-Calibration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Multi-Sensor Stream Processing&lt;/b&gt;: Support simultaneous processing of dual camera and LIDAR data streams&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Automatic Spatial Alignment&lt;/b&gt;: Perform real-time calibration to superimpose LIDAR and camera outputs without manual intervention&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Zero-Touch Configuration&lt;/b&gt;: Enable plug-and-play sensor deployment for field scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scenescape Integration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sensor-to-Scene Calibration&lt;/b&gt;: Automatically calibrate LIDAR-camera sensor pairs within the 3D scene environment&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bounding Box Fusion&lt;/b&gt;: Process and align detection bounding boxes from calibrated LIDAR-camera systems&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Spatial Mapping&lt;/b&gt;: Auto-calibrate fused sensor outputs to real-world coordinate space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Value Proposition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Eliminate complex manual calibration procedures for field deployments&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Enable rapid scaling of multi-sensor installations&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Reduce deployment time and technical expertise requirements&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Improve accuracy and consistency of sensor fusion outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
